== Installation ==

1. In the WordPress Dashboard go to **Plugins**, then click the **Add Plugins** button and search the WordPress Plugins Directory for elink. Alternatively you can download the plugin from <a href="https://d1sf3a4rercrry.cloudfront.net/wordpress/1.1.0/elink-embed.zip">here</a> and upload manually.
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' screen in WordPress.
3. Begin embedding content!

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= What does the plugin do? =

The elink embed plugin helps you create visual collections of any content on the web and then embed it on to your website or blog for faster content generation.

= What is elink? =

elink is an all-in-one content curation tool that helps you save and edit weblinks from anywhere on the web and turn them into collections that can be shared as beautiful email newsletters, website content, single web pages, social media bio links and much more! Generate content at the speed of light and share it anywhere with elink.io!

= Who should use elink? =

elink is perfect for agencies, business owners, small businesses, bloggers, designers, anyone with a WordPress website and wants an easy way to create pages for their websites or send newsletters.

= Do I need to have coding skills to use the elink plugin? =

Not at all. You can create and embed beautiful content without any coding using our user-friendly drag and drop content builder.

= How do I upgrade? =

The elink paid tiers are built for those who want more advanced functionality. If you’d like to learn more about elink's paid tiers, view our <a href="https://about.elink.io/pricing" target="_blank">pricing page</a>.

= My question is not listed. =

Please visit the <a href="https://help.elink.io" target="_blank">elink Help Center</a> or in-app chat for support. Thank you!

